# API transport

Read `docs/API_CLIENT_REFERENCE.md` and the backend contract links in `docs/PROJECT_FACTS.md`.

- Workspace REST uses `packages/web/src/shared/api/messenger-transport.internal.ts` and concrete `messenger-*.ts` / `workspace-*.ts` clients. Preserve Bearer authentication, organization/project context, cancellation, and DTO validation.
- `packages/web/src/shared/api/client.ts` and `zulip-*.ts` contain legacy transport. Do not route new Workspace requests through Zulip middleware or Basic authentication.
- Reuse the correct transport for URL, auth, error, and response handling; do not duplicate those concerns in pages or components.
- Verify retry behavior at the actual call site. Do not assume all requests retry or blindly retry a non-idempotent mutation.
- Mock the concrete module imported by the caller. Cover malformed responses and owner changes when those contracts change; see `docs/ORG_SCOPED_ASYNC_SAFETY.md`.
